WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.720
- All right, let's finish
up with something sure

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:04.403
to make you smile, "This
is what I'm liking".

00:00:04.403 --> 00:00:05.464
(upbeat music)

00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:07.715
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.715 --> 00:00:09.980
Early this year, 11 year
old Brody, came out as gay

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:12.550
and sadly, some people
were just awful about it.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.270
A few of his friends were mean

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:16.140
or they just flat out
stopped talking to him.

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.450
You know, kids.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.570
Well, it's no wonder when his
12th birthday rolled around,

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:20.980
he had no interest in having a party,

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:24.460
telling his mom, "I don't
have anyone to invite."

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.480
Like a good mom, she came up with a plan.

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.980
She put together a surprise
barbecue at a local park

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:32.830
and posted an invite for her
friends on social media to see.

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.520
Nearly a hundred friends and
total strangers showed up

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:36.916
to help celebrate Brody.

00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:38.150
(audience cheering)

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.050
Let's take a look.

00:00:39.949 --> 00:00:42.366
(indistinct)

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:46.186
- [Woman] People just wanted to tell you

00:00:46.186 --> 00:00:47.924
how much they love you.

00:00:47.924 --> 00:00:50.007
- This is the best birthday ever!

00:00:50.007 --> 00:00:52.441
(people cheering)

00:00:52.441 --> 00:00:53.379
(audience cheering)

00:00:53.379 --> 00:00:54.990
- All right, we have Brody and his mom

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.491
on the line right now.

00:00:56.491 --> 00:00:57.620
(audience cheering)

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.547
Hi guys, how are you? Happy birthday!

00:00:59.547 --> 00:01:01.380
(audience cheering)

00:01:01.380 --> 00:01:03.520
- Good to see ya.
- Thank you.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.393
- Tell me Brody, was that a surprise?

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:07.350
- Were you surprised?

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:08.233
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:08.233 --> 00:01:09.860
(all laughing)

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:11.823
- Tell me, how was the party?

00:01:13.525 --> 00:01:15.193
- It was really good.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:18.993
My mom and brother were in on it.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:23.947
My brother said, "What are
all those people there for?"

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:27.007
- There was a big group
there and he's like,

00:01:27.007 --> 00:01:29.440
"What are all these people here for?"

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:31.630
- I thought they were there
for the ice cream truck.

00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:36.330
But when I realized that
they were all there for me

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:40.337
and there were cameras pointed to me.

00:01:40.337 --> 00:01:41.200
- [Woman] Yeah.

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.166
- [Brody] I just started to tear up.

00:01:43.166 --> 00:01:43.999
- [Man] Yeah.

00:01:43.999 --> 00:01:46.470
- [Brody] I hugged my mom.

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:47.780
- [Woman] Yeah.

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.390
- [Brody] She had to pull
me away from the party.

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:51.730
- Yeah, he was a little overwhelmed.

00:01:51.730 --> 00:01:52.730
- Well, as you go through life,

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:54.810
you'll find more and
more people on your side,

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:55.643
that's what life is.

00:01:55.643 --> 00:01:58.020
There always more people
on your side than not.

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:01.010
And there's always gonna be
those people and you know,

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:03.410
all the people on your side
make you a stronger person.

00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:05.270
I'm glad you had an amazing birthday.

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:06.710
God bless you, man and both of you.

00:02:06.710 --> 00:02:07.543
What a great mom.

00:02:07.543 --> 00:02:09.420
Thanks, happy birthday, Brody.

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.278
Everybody, happy birthday, Brody.

00:02:11.278 --> 00:02:12.111
(audience cheering)

00:02:12.111 --> 00:02:14.703
- Happy birthday, Brody!

00:02:14.703 --> 00:02:15.969
(audience cheering)

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:17.718
- [Man] We're liking your post right now.

00:02:17.718 --> 00:02:18.900
(audience cheering)

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.110
Hey, that's not all,
Kelly's long season partner,

00:02:21.110 --> 00:02:23.790
Pilot Pen, the go-to pen
in the Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:26.560
wants to honor ultimate
overachievers just like you guys.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:30.060
There'll be using their G2 gel
ink pen to write you a check

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:31.490
for $1,000.

00:02:31.490 --> 00:02:32.618
So there you go, all right.

00:02:32.618 --> 00:02:33.451
(audience cheering)

00:02:33.451 --> 00:02:34.690
All right, smile on that.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:37.444
Now before you go, I remind
you, I gotta new game show.

00:02:37.444 --> 00:02:40.200
It's a revival of the type of
game show you bet your life.

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:42.600
Check on local listings,
find out when it's on.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:44.753
Thanks everybody, thanks for having me on.

